ned the duo onto their record label Star Trak Entertainment. The Neptunes would go on to handle the production on Lord Willin', with Pharrell Williams featuring on 6 different tracks, including the .","desc_lfm_artist":"Clipse are a critically acclaimed hip hop duo that formed in Virginia Beach, Virginia in 1992.  They announced the end of their career together at a live show in 2010 and remained firm on this stance, up until 2024 when Pharrell announced a new album with them.\nThe duo is made up of brothers Gene \"No Malice\" Thornton and Terrence \"Pusha T\" Thornton, who is also currently signed to Kanye West's G.O.O.D Music label. They met Pharrell of the producing duo The Neptunes","desc_mb_album":null,"desc_mb_artist":null,"yt_id":"3kMXMGixvtI","genres":[],"rym":"https://rateyourmusic.com/release/album/clipse/lord-willin","scaruffi_rating":null,"scaruffi_note":null,"wikipedia_url":null,"aoty_user_score":81,"aoty_critic_score":69,"metacritic_score":null,"label":null},{"n":10,"title":"Hitler Wears Hermes 8: Side B","artist":"Westside Gunn","year":2021,"mbid":"717eb45b-b503-4f92-84eb-08053b6cbd31","heard":true,"cover":"https://cdn2.albumoftheyear.org/600x0/album/409869-hitler-wears-hermes-8-side-b_014036.jpg","spotify_id":null,"spotify_url":null,"desc_lfm_album":"Hitler Wears Hermes 8: Side B is the second part of Westside Gunn’s double album, Hitler Wears Hermes 8: Sincerely Adolf. It was released on September 24, 2021. The mixtape features a wide variety of artists, such as Tyler, The Creator, 2 Chainz, and Jay Electronica, as well as fellow rappers Stove God Cooks, Benny the Butcher, Conway the Machine, Mach-Hommy, and many more. On June 11, Westside Gunn announced on Twitter two official release dates for two albums that would be dropping, the Side-A of the double album and the then-rumored Side-B of the double album, saying: \"Idk who .","desc_lfm_artist":"Alvin Lamar Worthy (born July 27, 1982), known professionally as Westside Gunn, is an American rapper. 